                    Nodis.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d257-f2" n="2" xml:id="d257-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d256-f2">footnote 2, Document 256</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d257-f3" n="3" xml:id="d257-f3-content">
                <p>No record of their meeting was found. In a February 21 memorandum to the
                    President following talks with Healey,
                    Secretary McNamara commented on the
                        U.K. decision to buy F-111 aircraft: “This
                    decision, in my view, is a major one helping to lock the British into a
                    meaningful role East of Suez.” (Johnson Library, National Security File, Country
                    File, UK, Vol. 8)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
